  "description": "Retail price is $1,500USD\n\n\"CHUNK\" is a masterpiece from \"CRUMBWORKS\"\n\nI wanted more people to enjoy it.\nThat desire led to the mass-produced \"The Chunk\"\n\n\"The Chunk\" faithfully recreates my wishes.\nFat tire clearance and beautiful curves.\n\nA fusion of old and new specs. That's our specialty.\nThe shape is retro, but somehow modern. Neo Rétro ATB.\n\nThe difference from the Japanese version is the welding and tube materials.\nThe outer diameter of the top tube has been changed to 28.6mm.\nHeat-treated tubing has been used to increase rigidity.\nHigh strength TIG welding is used.\nAnd, passed the \"ISO City/Trekking standard test\"\n\nBut \"The Chunk\" is not a mountain bike.\nIt's not designed for action riding like downhill or dirt jumping.\nPlease understand.\n\n26x2.8\" / 27.5x2.8\" / 700 x 50c\n\n\"The Chunk\" offers a lot of flexibility with its tire size. It offers a lot of fun.\n\nCommuter bike with a carrier, basket, and fenders.\nTouring style with camping gear packed in bags.\nNeo-ATB style with 2.8\" tires and a dropper.\n\nI hope you'll enjoy it freely and with your own unique ideas.\n\n・3 sets bottle cage mounts.\n・Rear rack and mudguard mounts.\n・Full-length cable housing guides for derailleurs and brakes.\n・Triple cage mounts.\n・Stealth Dynamo routing.\n・Kickstand plate.\n・Passed the \"ISO City/Trekking standard test\"\n・Made in Taiwan.\n\nFrame Geometry",
